{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02907","headline":"奉和展礼岱宗涂经濮济 · 萧楚材","name":"奉和展礼岱宗涂经濮济","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂汉星旗转，分霄日羽明。\n将追会阜迹，更勒岱宗铭。\n林戈咽济岸，兽鼓震河庭。\n叶箭凌寒矫，鸟弓望晓惊。\n已降汾水作，仍深迎渭情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧楚材","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}